// Source: MicrosoftDocs/power-platform / power-platform/admin/telemetry-events-model-driven-apps.md
// Which userAgents (i.e. access paths — Browser, Power Automate, Office, etc.) are hitting the system, per user.
pageViews
| summarize count() by tostring(customDimensions.userAgent), user_Id

dependencies
| where ['type'] == "UCI REQUEST"
